\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Be it my only wisdom here
\par To serve the Lord with faithful fear,
\par With loving gratitude;
\par Superior sense may I display,
\par By shunning every evil way,
\par And walking in the good.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O may I still from sin depart!
\par A wise and understanding heart,
\par Jesus, to me be given;
\par And let me through Thy Spirit know
\par To glorify my God below,
\par And find my way to heaven.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

